,华南,耳机,2,899,1798\r\n46: 2026-08-06,华东,平板,5,2599,12995\r\n47: 2026-08-06,华北,智能手表,1,1499,1499\r\n48: 2026-08-06,华南,智能手表,5,1499,7495\r\n49: 2026-08-06,华北,笔记本,3,6999,20997\r\n50: 2026-08-06,华北,智能手表,5,1499,7495\r\n51: 2026-08-06,华东,智能手表,3,1499,4497\r\n52: 2026-08-06,西南,手机,1,3999,3999\r\n53: 2026-08-06,华南,平板,2,2599,5198\r\n54: 2026-08-06,华东,笔记本,5,6999,34995\r\n55: 2026-08-06,华东,手机,4,3999,15996\r\n56:…(截断)"},{"id":"toolres-call_01_ET_90Q8W4esy9hVqlW2macT3219","role":"tool","toolCallId":"call_01_ET_90Q8W4esy9hVqlW2macT3219","content":"Read file /home/ubuntu/dataagent/workspace/threads/vision-b-charts/region-sales-2026-08-result.csv, lines 1-5\n1: 华北,388082,118\n2: 华东,366096,104\n3: 华中,285225,75\n4: 西南,171346,54\n5: 华南,149951,49"},{"id":"toolres-call_02_ET_VHRW8UKgahBWpIwGAdDe8902","role":"tool","toolCallId":"call_02_ET_VHRW8UKgahBWpIwGAdDe8902","content":"Read file /home/ubuntu/dataagent/workspace/threads/vision-b-charts/dashboard-sales-2026-08.a2ui.json, lines 1-148\n1: {\n2:   \"surfaceId\": \"sales-dashboard-2026-08\",\n3:   \"catalogId\": \"https://opencode-agui-app.local/a2ui/data-agent-catalog.json\",\n4:   \"data\": {\n5:     \"totalSales\": 1360700,\n6:     \"totalQty\": 400,\n7:     \"orderLines\": 137,\n8:     \"regionCount\": 5,\n9:     \"dayCount\": 13,\n10:     \"dailyAvg\": 104669\n11:   },\n12:   \"components\": [\n13:     {\n14:       \"component\": \"Column\",\n15:       \"id\": \"root\",\n16:       \"children\": [\"title\", \"subtitle\", \"metric-row\", \"chart-row\", \"daily-line\", \"region-table\", \"category-table\", \"insight\"]\n17:     },\n18:     {\n19:       \"component\": \"Text\",\n20:       \"id\": \"title\",\n21:       \"variant\": \"h2\",\n22:       \"text\": \"📈 2026年8月销售分析看板（按区域）\"\n23:     },\n24:     {\n25:       \"component\": \"Text\",\n26:       \"id\": \"subtitle\",\n27:       \"variant\": \"caption\",\n28:       \"text\": \"数据区间：2026-08-01 ~ 08-13 · 137 笔订单行 · 5 大区域 · 总销售额 ¥1,360,700\"\n29:     },\n30:     {\n31:       \"component\": \"Row\",\n32:       \"id\": \"metric-row\",\n33:       \"children\": [\"m1\", \"m2\", \"m3\", \"m4\"]\n34:     },\n35:     {\n36:       \"component\": \"MetricCard\",\n37:       \"id\": \"m1\",\n38:       \"title\": \"本月总销售额\",\n39:       \"value\": \"¥1,360,700\"\n40:     },\n41:     {\n42:       \"component\": \"MetricCard\",\n43:       \"id\": \"m2\",\n44:       \"title\": \"本月总销量\",\n45:       \"value\": \"400 件\"\n46:     },\n47:     {\n48:       \"component\": \"MetricCard\",\n49:       \"id\": \"m3\",\n50:       \"title\": \"覆盖区域 / 天数\",\n51:       \"value\": \"5 区域 / 13 天\"\n52:     },\n53:     {\n54:       \"component\": \"MetricCard\",\n55:       \"id\": \"m4\",\n56:       \"title\": \"日均销售额\",\n57:       \"value\": \"¥104,669\"\n58:     },\n59:     {\n60:       \"component\": \"Row\",\n61:       \"id\": \"chart-row\",\n62:       \"children\": [\"region-bar\", \"category-bar\"]\n63:     },\n64:     {\n65:       \"component\": \"BarChart\",\n66:       \"id\": \"region-bar\",\n67:       \"title\": \"各区域销售额对比（元）\",\n68:       \"xField\": \"区域\",\n69:       \"yField\": \"销售额\",\n70:       \"data\": [\n71: …(截断)"},{"id":"msg_003ba1895001XYvO1PsxZKBFV5-r","role":"reasoning","content":"There's already a dashboard file. Let me check if the CSV is complete — the file ends at line 138 (08-13). The existing dashboard references data through 08-13 with 137 order lines. Let me verify by reading the full CSV. The read showed lines 1-138, so the CSV has 137 data rows. That matches.\n\nNow let me compute the actual numbers to verify, and prepare the render_a2ui call. The user wants:\n- surfaceId=v-charts\n- Row with 3 MetricCard (总销售额/订单量/客单价, with delta and trend)\n- BarChart (区域销售额)\n- LineChart (按日趋势)\n- PieChart (区域占比)\n- DataTable (区域明细, columns with key+label)\n- data in data model, bind with {path}\n\nLet me verify the computations from the CSV using the existing result file which confirms region aggregates. The existing dashboard has totalSales 1360700, orderLines 137, totalQty 400.\n\nLet me compute 客单价 (avg order value). With orderLines 137 and totalSales 1360700: 1360700/137 ≈ 9932.1. Or maybe 客单价 = totalSales / orderCount where orderCount = order lines = 137? 1360700/137 = 9932. Let me compute precisely: 137 * 9932 = 1360684. 1360700-1360684 = 16, so ≈ 9932.12.\n\nActually, \"订单量\" = order count. 137 order lines. 客单价 = 1360700/137 ≈ ¥9,932.\n\nLet me verify totals quickly with a shell command to be accurate, and also get daily and region data. Actually the existing JSON already has verified numbers, and the region-sales result CSV matches. I can rely on those. But let me do a quick verification computation for delta/trend.\n\nFor MetricCard with delta and trend — I need to compute deltas. I could compute day-to-day or week-over-week. Let me compute deltas vs. previous period. The data is 08-01 to 08-13. I could compare first half vs second half, or compute day-over-day for daily avg. Simplest: compute delta for total sales comparing first 6 days vs last 7 days, or compare to a benchmark.\n\nActually, let me just compute meaningful deltas:\n- 总销售额 delta: could compare 08-07~08-13 vs 08-01~08-07. Let me compute from daily data.\n- 订单量 delta: similar split.\n- 客单价 delta: similar split.\n\nDaily totals from the dashboard JSON:\n08-01: 86683\n08-02: 121666\n08-03: 105075\n08-04: 56572\n08-05: 97370\n08-06: 135654\n08-07: 98071\n08-08: 168261\n08-09: 144659\n08-10: 105771\n08-11: 53079\n08-12: 93673\n08-13: 94166\n\nSum check: Let me verify 08-01..08-06 (6 days): 86683+121666 = 208349; +105075 = 313424; +56572 = 369996; +97370 = 467366; +135654 = 603020. 08-07..08-13 (7 days): 98071+168261 = 266332; +144659 = 410991; +105771 = 516762; +53079 = 569841; +93673 = 663514; +94166 = 757680. Total = 603020+757680 = 1360700. ✓\n\nPer-day avg: first 6 days 603020/6 = 100503.3; last 7 days 757680/7 = 108240. Delta = +7.7% (108240-100503)/100503 = 7.70%.\n\nHmm, that's a reasonable delta for total sales.\n\nFor order count (订单量 = order lines), I need per-day counts. Let me compute from the CSV. Actually let me just run a quick awk to compute all aggregates accurately rather than eyeballing. Let me run shell computations.\n\nLet me compute daily metrics (sales, qty, lines), plus verify. I'll use awk on the CSV."},{"id":"msg_003ba1895001XYvO1PsxZKBFV5","role":"assistant","content":"","toolCalls":[{"id":"call_00_mglbeIfB3JgbU1XZ6VKr1551","type":"function","function":{"name":"shell","arguments":"{\"command\":\"cd workspace/threads/vision-b-charts && awk -F, 'NR>1{d[$1]+=$6; q[$1]+=$4; n[$1]++} END{for(k in d) print k, d[k], q[k], n[k]}' sales-2026-08.csv | sort && echo \\\"---totals---\\\" && awk -F, 'NR>1{s+=$6; q+=$4; n++} END{print \\\"sales\\\",s,\\\"qty\\\",q,\\\"lines\\\",n}' sales-2026-08.csv\"}"}}]},{"id":"toolres-call_00_mglbeIfB3JgbU1XZ6VKr1551","role":"tool","toolCallId":"call_00_mglbeIfB3JgbU1XZ6VKr1551","content":"2026-08-01 86683 17 7\n2026-08-02 121666 34 12\n2026-08-03 105075 25 7\n2026-08-04 56572 28 9\n2026-08-05 97370 30 9\n2026-08-06 135654 46 13\n2026-08-07 98071 29 12\n2026-08-08 168261 39 13\n2026-08-09 144659 41 13\n2026-08-10 105771 29 7\n2026-08-11 53079 21 11\n2026-08-12 93673 27 10\n2026-08-13 94166 34 14\n---totals---\nsales 1360700 qty 400 lines 137\n\nCommand exited with code 0."},{"id":"msg_003ba3dbb001ukyIRJ1x9pFWzz-r","role":"reasoning","content":"Now compute the splits for delta (前半 08-01~08-07 vs 后半 08-08~08-13):\n- 前半(7天): 销售 = 603020+98071 = 701091; 订单行 = 7+12+7+9+9+13+12 = 69; 客单价 = 701091/69 = 10160.7\n- 后半(6天): 销售 = 168261+144659+105771+53079+93673+94166 = 659609; 订单行 = 13+13+7+11+10+14 = 68; 客单价 = 659609/68 = 9700.1\n\nWait, let me redo: 前半 08-01..08-07 (7 days): sales = 86683+121666+105075+56572+97370+135654+98071 = 701091. lines = 7+12+7+9+9+13+12 = 69. 后半 08-08..08-13 (6 days): sales = 168261+144659+105771+53079+93673+94166 = 659609. lines = 13+13+7+11+10+14 = 68.\n\nDelta sales: (659609-701091)/701091 = -5.9%. 订单量 delta: (68-69)/69 = -1.4%. 客单价: 前半 701091/69=10160.7; 后半 659609/68=9700.1; delta = -4.5%.\n\nHmm, those all negative, which is a bit odd but fine. Alternatively use daily averages which smooths the unequal periods: daily avg sales 前半 = 701091/7 = 100155.9; 后半 = 659609/6 = 109934.8; delta = +9.8%.\n\nActually, using daily avg for the KPI comparisons would give a positive trend. But for simplicity and consistency, I could use total delta. Hmm. Let me think about what makes a sensible dashboard: total sales delta = (后半日均 - 前半日均)/前半日均 = +9.8% upward trend. Order count: 后半日均 11.3 vs 前半日均 9.86 → +14.9%. 客单价: using per-line: -4.5%.\n\nActually cleaner to compare equal-length windows. Let me use the last 6 days vs the 6 days before (08-01..08-06):\n- 前半6天: 603020, lines 57. 后半6天: 659609, lines 68.\n- sales delta = +9.4% up\n- orders delta = (68-57)/57 = +19.3% up\n- 客单价: 前半 603020/57 = 10579.3; 后半 659609/68 = 9700.1 → -8.3% down\n\nHmm, 客单价 down. That's a real story: volume up, AOV down.\n\nAlternatively use weekday-over-weekday? Too complex. I'll go with last 6 days vs prior 6 days:\n- 总销售额: +9.4% (trend up)\n- 订单量: +19.3% (trend up)\n- 客单价: -8.3% (trend down)\n\nThese are honest, defensible. Good.\n\nNow build the render_a2ui call with surfaceId=v-charts, data model, {path} bindings.\n\nComponents:\n- root Column with children [title, metricRow, regionBar, dailyLine, regionPie, regionTable]\n- Text title\n- Row metric-row: children [m1, m2, m3]\n- MetricCard m1: title 总销售额, value {path} binding, delta, trend. MetricCard props: title, value, delta?, trend?. value can be path-bound via {path}. \n- BarChart: title, xField, yField, data (data from model path)\n- LineChart: title, xField, yField, data\n- PieChart: title, labelField, valueField, data\n- DataTable: columns [{key,label}], rows (from data path)\n\nData model:\n{\n  totalSales: 1360700,\n  orderCount: 137,\n  avgOrderValue: 9932,\n  regionBar: [ {区域, 销售额}, ... ] with keys region/sales\n  dailyLine: [ {日期, 销售额} ]\n  regionPie: [ {区域, 销售额} ]\n  regionTable: { columns: [{key,label}...], rows: [...] } — hmm, columns contract says \"columns:[{key,label}]\" for DataTable (A2UI). The tool description says DataTable{columns:[{key,label}],rows}. So columns must be [{key,label}] — but the user said \"columns 带 key+label\". So I'll bind columns to a data path too, or inline them. I'll put them in data model as well for full binding.\n\nLet me put columns in data: regionTableColumns: [{key:\"region\",label:\"区域\"},...], and rows: [{region:\"华北\",sales:388082,qty:118,pct:\"28.5%\"},...].\n\nBind: DataTable columns: {path} pointing to data.regionTableColumns, rows: {path} pointing to data.regionTableRows.\n\nFor MetricCard values: value: {path:\"data.totalSales\"} — but formatting to currency? A2UI path binding will substitute raw number. Possibly fine. To include formatting maybe provide strings in data: totalSales: \"¥1,360,700\". Simpler: store formatted strings. But delta/trend: delta \"9.4%\", trend \"up\".\n\nLet me define data with display strings:\ndata = {\n  totalSales: \"¥1,360,700\",\n  totalSalesDelta: \"+9.4%\",\n  totalSalesTrend: \"up\",\n  orderCount: \"137 单\",\n  orderCountDelta: \"+19.3%\",\n  orderCountTrend: \"up\",\n  avgOrderValue: \"¥9,932\",\n  avgOrderValueDelta: \"-8.3%\",\n  avgOrderValueTrend: \"down\",\n  regionBar: [{name:\"华北\",value:388082},...],\n  dailyLine: [{name:\"08-01\",value:86683},...],\n  regionPie: [{name:\"华北\",value:388082},...],\n  regionTableCols: [{key:\"region\",label:\"区域\"},{key:\"sales\",label:\"销售额(元)\"},{key:\"qty\",label:\"销量(件)\"},{key:\"pct\",label:\"占比\"}],\n  regionTableRows: [{region:\"华北\",sales:388082,qty:118,pct:\"28.5%\"},...]\n}\n\nNote: the tool contract for MetricCard: MetricCard{title,value,delta?,trend?}. Use value {path}.\n\nLet me construct the components. Use paths in the component fields referencing data keys. The convention: {path} binding. For charts data: data: {path:\"data.regionBar\"}? The binding uses {path:\"...\"}. For scalar: value: {path:\"data.totalSales\"}.\n\nI'll write the call. Note that delta/trend per contract. Fine.\n\nNow call render_a2ui."},{"id":"msg_003ba3dbb001ukyIRJ1x9pFWzz","role":"assistant","content":"","toolCalls":[{"id":"call_00_K3SuTluwBuLcqi5HoQRA3685","type":"function","function":{"name":"render_a2ui","arguments":"{\"surfaceId\":\"v-charts\",\"components\":[{\"component\":\"Column\",\"id\":\"root\",\"children\":[\"title\",\"metric-row\",\"region-bar\",\"daily-line\",\"region-pie\",\"region-table\"]},{\"component\":\"Text\",\"id\":\"title\",\"variant\":\"h2\",\"text\":\"📈 2026年8月销售看板（1~13日）\"},{\"component\":\"Row\",\"id\":\"metric-row\",\"children\":[\"m1\",\"m2\",\"m3\"]},{\"component\":\"MetricCard\",\"id\":\"m1\",\"title\":\"总销售额\",\"value\":{\"path\":\"data.totalSales\"},\"delta\":{\"path\":\"data.totalSalesDelta\"},\"trend\":{\"path\":\"data.totalSalesTrend\"}},{\"component\":\"MetricCard\",\"id\":\"m2\",\"title\":\"订单量\",\"value\":{\"path\":\"data.orderCount\"},\"delta\":{\"path\":\"data.orderCountDelta\"},\"trend\":{\"path\":\"data.orderCountTrend\"}},{\"component\":\"MetricCard\",\"id\":\"m3\",\"title\":\"客单价\",\"value\":{\"path\":\"data.avgOrderValue\"},\"delta\":{\"path\":\"data.avgOrderValueDelta\"},\"trend\":{\"path\":\"data.avgOrderValueTrend\"}},{\"component\":\"BarChart\",\"id\":\"region-bar\",\"title\":\"各区域销售额（元）\",\"xField\":\"name\",\"yField\":\"value\",\"data\":{\"path\":\"data.regionBar\"}},{\"component\":\"LineChart\",\"id\":\"daily-line\",\"title\":\"每日销售额趋势（元）\",\"xField\":\"name\",\"yField\":\"value\",\"data\":{\"path\":\"data.dailyLine\"}},{\"component\":\"PieChart\",\"id\":\"region-pie\",\"title\":\"区域销售额占比\",\"labelField\":\"name\",\"valueField\":\"value\",\"data\":{\"path\":\"data.regionPie\"}},{\"component\":\"DataTable\",\"id\":\"region-table\",\"title\":\"区域销售明细\",\"columns\":{\"path\":\"data.regionTableCols\"},\"rows\":{\"path\":\"data.regionTableRows\"}}],\"data\":{\"totalSales\":\"¥1,360,700\",\"totalSalesDelta\":\"+9.4%\",\"totalSalesTrend\":\"up\",\"orderCount\":\"137 单\",\"orderCountDelta\":\"+19.3%\",\"orderCountTrend\":\"up\",\"avgOrderValue\":\"¥9,932\",\"avgOrderValueDelta\":\"-8.3%\",\"avgOrderValueTrend\":\"down\",\"regionBar\":[{\"name\":\"华北\",\"value\":388082},{\"name\":\"华东\",\"value\":366096},{\"name\":\"华中\",\"value\":285225},{\"name\":\"西南\",\"value\":171346},{\"name\":\"华南\",\"value\":149951}],\"dailyLine\":[{\"name\":\"08-01\",\"value\":86683},{\"name\":\"08-02\",\"value\":121666},{\"name\":\"08-03\",\"value\":105075},{\"name\":\"08-04\",\"value\":56572},{\"name\":\"08-05\",\"value\":97370},{\"name\":\"08-06\",\"value\":135654},{\"name\":\"08-07\",\"value\":98071},{\"name\":\"08-08\",\"value\":168261},{\"name\":\"08-09\",\"value\":144659},{\"name\":\"08-10\",\"value\":105771},{\"name\":\"08-11\",\"value\":53079},{\"name\":\"08-12\",\"value\":93673},{\"name\":\"08-13\",\"value\":94166}],\"regionPie\":[{\"name\":\"华北\",\"value\":388082},{\"name\":\"华东\",\"value\":366096},{\"name\":\"华中\",\"value\":285225},{\"name\":\"西南\",\"value\":171346},{\"name\":\"华南\",\"value\":149951}],\"regionTableCols\":[{\"key\":\"region\",\"label\":\"区域\"},{\"key\":\"sales\",\"label\":\"销售额(元)\"},{\"key\":\"qty\",\"label\":\"销量(件)\"},{\"key\":\"pct\",\"label\":\"销售额占比\"}],\"regionTableRows\":[{\"region\":\"华北\",\"sales\":388082,\"qty\":118,\"pct\":\"28.5%\"},{\"region\":\"华东\",\"sales\":366096,\"qty\":104,\"pct\":\"26.9%\"},{\"region\":\"华中\",\"sales\":285225,\"qty\":75,\"pct\":\"21.0%\"},{\"region\":\"西南\",\"sales\":171346,\"qty\":54,\"pct\":\"12.6%\"},{\"region\":\"华南\",\"sales\":149951,\"qty\":49,\"pct\":\"11.0%\"}]}}"}}]},{"id":"toolres-call_00_K3SuTluwBuLcqi5HoQRA3685","role":"tool","toolCallId":"call_00_K3SuTluwBuLcqi5HoQRA3685","content":"UI surface \"v-charts\" rendered (10 components). The user can already see it; do NOT paste the JSON back into chat."}]}

